    "created_at": "2018-05-31T19:47:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-31T19:47:06Z",
    "body": "```\r\nSELECT\r\n  page,\r\n  url\r\nFROM\r\n  [httparchive:response_bodies.2018_05_01_desktop]\r\nWHERE\r\n  REGEXP_MATCH(LOWER(body), r'(<t[dh]\\s+(?:[a-z0-9_:-]+\\s*(?:=\\s*(?:\"[^\"]*\"|\\'[^\\']*\\'|[^\"\\' >]+))?\\s+)*hidden(?:\\s|[=>])[^>]*>)')\r\n```\r\nhttp://www.tmparts.ru/ has this\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<td id=\"site-title-sticky\" hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                <div class=\"site-title-inverse\"><a class=\"site-title-inverse\" href=\"/\"> </a></div>\r\n            </td>\r\n```\r\ni.e. it also set `display: none;` so it wouldn't be impacted.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.partykaro.com/ has\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<td id=\"ctl00_tdMessage\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 10px 0px 0px 10px;\" hidden=\"hidden\">\r\n                                <span id=\"ctl00_lblMessage\">You are already registered.</span>\r\n                            </td>\r\n```\r\nThis would change the \"Sign up\" box dimensions slightly with the spec's UA style.\r\n\r\n...and that's all I could find.",
